# ncurses, target native: the curses of the programs of the build machine (lfs/lynx:native, lfs/libedit:native
# and the lldb of the global LLVM), with the terminfo database of the global toolchain
### The headers in include too, not only in include/ncursesw (the default outside /usr): the
### programs of the build machine include <curses.h> (libedit, the curses GUI of lldb)
CONF_FLAGS+=" --enable-overwrite"
### The Version of ncursesw.pc is ${version}, the variable is <version>.<patch date>
PKG_CHECK="grep -q '^version=${PKG_VER}\.' ${INSTALL_LIBDIR}/pkgconfig/ncursesw.pc && [ -f ${INSTALL_INCLUDEDIR}/curses.h ] && [ -f ${INSTALL_LIBDIR}/libpanel.so ]"
